<title>USA: CBOT soybeans sharply down on liquidation, weather.</title>
<headline>CBOT soybeans sharply down on liquidation, weather.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>CBOT soybeans were sharply lower early Wednesday on favorable growing weather and liquidation in July, floor traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;With the report and first notice day on Monday, everybody wants to get out of July,&quot; said a trader. &quot;It's too volatile.&quot;</p>
</text>
